    <!-- ============ PRICING ============ -->
    <section class="section" id="pricing" aria-labelledby="pricingTitle">
      <div class="container split">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">Pricing</span>
          <h2 id="pricingTitle">Low entry cost. No hourly rates.</h2>
          <p class="lead" style="margin:0.9rem 0 1.2rem">A "from" price to start, then a fixed quote for your scope before we build — you pay for the outcome, not the hours.</p>
          <p class="callout"><strong>Nothing to pay until you accept a fixed quote.</strong> Then a R500 deposit gets the build going and comes off your project price; the balance is due on completion.</p>
          <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:1.2rem">
            <a href="start" class="btn btn--primary">Get an estimate</a>
            <a href="pricing" class="btn btn--ghost">Full price list</a>
          </div>
          <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:1rem">A live site needs hosting — from R50 a month (R500 a year) to stay online (short-term for events). You own your domain. <a class="inline-link" href="pricing#care">See plans</a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal">
          <ul class="price-list">
            <li><a href="pricing#builds">Quick builds<small>Forms, calculators, small tools, landing pages</small></a><span class="price"><small>from</small>R1,000</span></li>
            <li><a href="services#websites">Quick website<small>One-page business presence, live fast</small></a><span class="price"><small>from</small>R1,000</span></li>
            <li><a href="services#websites">Business website<small>Up to 4–5 pages, custom layout</small></a><span class="price"><small>from</small>R2,000</span></li>
            <li><a href="services#dashboards">Dashboards &amp; automation<small>Built around your real data and processes</small></a><span class="price"><small>from</small>R2,000</span></li>
            <li><a href="services#ai">AI integrations<small>API usage billed separately</small></a><span class="price"><small>from</small>R3,500</span></li>
            <li><a href="services#software">Custom software<small>Larger applications quoted individually</small></a><span class="price"><small>from</small>R4,500</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- ============ HOW IT WORKS ============ -->
    <section class="section section--tint" id="process" aria-labelledby="processTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">How it works</span>
          <h2 id="processTitle">From problem to launch, without the runaround.</h2>
        </div>
        <figure class="flow-film reveal">
          <video data-autoplay data-portrait="assets/video/flow-portrait" muted loop playsinline preload="none" poster="assets/video/flow-poster.jpg" width="1280" height="720" aria-label="A 24-second film: customers look you up online first, and without a website many call the next business. Then the free mockup route: tell us about your business, we build a free mockup, accept a fixed quote and pay the R500 deposit, and your site goes live.">
            <source src="assets/video/flow.webm" type="video/webm" />
            <source src="assets/video/flow.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
          </video>
        </figure>
        <ol class="steps reveal">
          <li class="step">
            <span class="step__num">1</span>
            <h3>Describe it</h3>
            <p>Tell us what you're trying to accomplish in the Project Builder — in your own words.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="step">
            <span class="step__num">2</span>
            <h3>See a price</h3>
            <p>Get an indicative estimate on the spot, based on what you've described.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="step">
            <span class="step__num">3</span>
            <h3>Get a fixed quote</h3>
            <p>Submit your project free. We review it and send you a fixed quote online — scope, price and delivery time — usually within 1 working day.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="step">
            <span class="step__num">4</span>
            <h3>Accept &amp; pay R500</h3>
            <p>Happy with it? Accept the quote online and pay the R500 deposit by card. It comes off your total.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="step">
            <span class="step__num">5</span>
            <h3>Build &amp; launch</h3>
            <p>We build, you review, the balance is paid on completion and your solution goes live.</p>
          </li>
        </ol>
        <div class="section__foot btn-row reveal">
          <a href="start" class="btn btn--primary">Start a Project</a>
          <a href="pricing" class="btn btn--ghost">See pricing &amp; the deposit</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

