      <div class="container trust">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">Why Re-Charge</span>
          <h2 id="whyTitle">Surprisingly good software, surprisingly quickly.</h2>
          <blockquote>You work directly with the person building your solution. <em>No account managers. No unnecessary meetings. No agency runaround.</em></blockquote>
          <p class="muted">A small, independent South African studio — so projects move fast, pricing is low and fixed, and you always know what you're getting.</p>
          <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:1.6rem">
            <a href="start" class="btn btn--light">Start a Project</a>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn--free" data-mockup-open>Get a mockup <span class="btn__tag">Free</span></button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <ul class="trust__points reveal">
          <li><strong>Fast</strong><span>Simple sites live in about 1–2 days.</span></li>
          <li><strong>Low entry cost</strong><span>Projects from R1,000. R500 deposit once you accept the quote.</span></li>
          <li><strong>Fixed pricing</strong><span>An estimate up front, a fixed quote before we build.</span></li>
          <li><strong>Custom</strong><span>Built around your business, not a template.</span></li>
          <li><strong>Direct</strong><span>Talk to the person doing the work.</span></li>
          <li><strong>You own it</strong><span>Your domain and data. We handle the tech.</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ FAQ ============ -->
    <section class="section section--tint" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faqTitle">
      <div class="container container--narrow">
        <div class="section__head section__head--center reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">Questions</span>
          <h2 id="faqTitle">Straight answers.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="faq reveal">
          <details class="faq__item">
            <summary>How much does a project cost?</summary>
            <p>Quick builds and one-page websites start from R1,000, a business website from R2,000, and custom websites from R4,500. Dashboards and automation start from R2,000, AI integrations from R3,500 and custom tools from R4,500. You see an indicative estimate before you pay, and a fixed quote once we've reviewed your project.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq__item">
            <summary>When do I pay the R500 deposit?</summary>
            <p><strong>Only once you've seen and accepted your fixed quote.</strong> Tell us what you need (free), we send you a fixed quote online with the scope, price and timeline, and if you're happy you accept it and pay the R500 deposit by card. It comes off your project price, and the balance is due on completion. Don't like the quote? Don't accept it — you haven't paid anything.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq__item">
            <summary>What if I don't know what I need?</summary>
            <p>That's completely fine, and it's a normal way to start. Tell us what you're currently doing, what's frustrating you, or what you'd like to improve. We'll work out what could be built to solve it. You don't need any technical terms.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq__item">
            <summary>How does hosting work?</summary>
            <p>A website is only live while it's hosted, so some hosting is required — separate from the one-off build. Ongoing sites take a plan, paid monthly or yearly (yearly is 2 months free): Hosting R50/month or R500/year, Care R100/month or R1,000/year (small changes, your Google Business Profile kept up to date and a monthly report), or Business Care R300/month or R3,000/year. New websites include the first year of Care. Event or once-off sites (a wedding, a launch) are hosted only for the period you need. You own your domain and can host elsewhere if you prefer.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq__item">
            <summary>Do you use templates?</summary>
            <p>We build around what your business needs, using reusable components and modern development methods so we can deliver quickly and keep prices low. You're buying the result and the speed, not a page-builder you'll have to fight later.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq__item">
            <summary>What about AI running costs?</summary>
            <p>Third-party AI/API usage is billed separately, based on actual usage, and we explain it before we build anything. We never bundle unlimited AI usage into a fixed project price.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq__item">
            <summary>Can I start small and grow later?</summary>
            <p>Yes — that's the idea. A R1,000 website is an entry point, not the end product. Many clients add a dashboard, an automation or a custom tool later, once the first thing is paying off.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ FINAL CTA ============ -->
